          "name": "Callback",
          "type": "TFunction<void ( FColor*,int32,int32 )>"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Resolve the specified viewport RHI, calling the specified callback with the result.\n@param\tBackBuffer\t\tThe backbuffer to resolve\n@param\tCallback \t\tCallback to call with the locked texture data. This will be called on an undefined thread."
    },
